  m_Name: Frostmere At the Edge of the Realm
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: 'Frostmere: At the Edge of the Realm'
  content: 'Beyond the northern forests lies Frostmere, where snow blankets the land
    for much of the year and the wind seldom rests. What began as a modest expedition
    outpost has become a settlement of scholars, explorers, and those willing to
    brave the frontier in pursuit of knowledge. Its libraries preserve accounts gathered
    from every corner of the world, and its researchers devote themselves to studying
    phenomena too distant, or too unusual for others to investigate.


    Few travelers
    remain in Frostmere longer than necessity demands, yet those who do often discover
    that the quiet of the north has a way of changing one''s perspective.'
